{"book":"zhongyong","id":"sishu.zhongyong.26","index":26,"passages":[{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.26.01","number":1,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"gù","traditional":"故","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhì","traditional":"至","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"诚","pinyin":"chéng","traditional":"誠","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"无","pinyin":"wú","traditional":"無","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xī","traditional":"息","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Maka yang mencapai puncak Iman itu tiada saat berhenti."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.26.02","number":2,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xī","traditional":"息","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"则","pinyin":"zé","traditional":"則","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jiǔ","traditional":"久","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"jiǔ","traditional":"久","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"则","pinyin":"zé","traditional":"則","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"征","pinyin":"zhēng","traditional":"徵","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}],[{"modern":"征","pinyin":"zhēng","traditional":"徵","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"则","pinyin":"zé","traditional":"則","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yōu","traditional":"悠","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"远","pinyin":"yuǎn","traditional":"遠","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"yōu","traditional":"悠","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"远","pinyin":"yuǎn","traditional":"遠","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"则","pinyin":"zé","traditional":"則","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bó","traditional":"博","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hòu","traditional":"厚","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"bó","traditional":"博","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hòu","traditional":"厚","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"则","pinyin":"zé","traditional":"則","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"gāo","traditional":"高","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"míng","traditional":"明","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Tiada saat berhenti maka berlangsung lamalah Dia; karena berlangsung lama Dia menghimpun banyak pengetahuan; karena menghimpun banyak pengetahuan, jauhlah yang dicapaiNya; karena jauh yang dicapaiNya, maka luas dan teballah pengertianNya; karena luas dan tebal pengertianNya, maka tinggi dan cemerlanglah Dia.","editorial_annotations":[{"id":"sishu.zhongyong.26.02.note.zhuxi.zheng","kind":"interpretive_comparison","after_paragraph_index":1,"anchor_hanzi":"久則徵","attribution":"朱熹 (Zhu Xi)","title_indonesian":"Perbandingan tafsir Zhu Xi — bukan terjemahan MATAKIN","description_indonesian":"MATAKIN menerjemahkan 久則徵 sebagai “karena berlangsung lama Dia menghimpun banyak pengetahuan”. Zhu Xi menekankan bahwa ketekunan atau ketetapan di dalam diri akhirnya menghasilkan tanda, bukti, atau hasil yang tampak di luar. Ini adalah catatan pembanding filologis, bukan koreksi atau pengganti terjemahan MATAKIN.","hanzi":"久，常於中也；徵，驗於外也。","witness":{"source_work":"朱熹《四書章句集註》","edition":"欽定四庫全書 (WYG)","witness_file":"KR1h0015_016.txt","witness_page":"KR1h0015_WYG_016-57b","source_commit":"84c6b2c5093c57ae5d41c60a73c02323d2420ef0","reference_url":"https://github.com/kanripo/KR1h0015/blob/84c6b2c5093c57ae5d41c60a73c02323d2420ef0/KR1h0015_016.txt","editorial_policy":"Zhu Xi is a secondary comparison; MATAKIN 2012 remains the project's primary edition."},"lexical_evidence":{"source":"臺灣教育部《重編國語辭典修訂本》","url":"https://dict.revised.moe.edu.tw/dictView.jsp?ID=7943&la=0&powerMode=0","note":"此處 徵 = 徵驗/證明, pinyin zhēng; zhǐ 只適用於古代音階第五聲。","limit":"Cetakan pinyin MATAKIN 2012 belum diperiksa langsung untuk dua karakter ini."}}]},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.26.03","number":3,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"bó","traditional":"博","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hòu","traditional":"厚","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"suǒ","traditional":"所","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"载","pinyin":"zài","traditional":"載","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wù","traditional":"物","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"gāo","traditional":"高","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"míng","traditional":"明","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"suǒ","traditional":"所","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"fù","traditional":"覆","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wù","traditional":"物","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"yōu","traditional":"悠","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jiǔ","traditional":"久","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"suǒ","traditional":"所","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"chéng","traditional":"成","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wù","traditional":"物","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Karena luas dan tebal maka mendukung segenap wujud; karena tinggi dan cemerlang, maka melindungi segenap wujud dan karena berlangsung lama dan jauh maka menyempurnakan segenap wujud."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.26.04","number":4,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"bó","traditional":"博","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hòu","traditional":"厚","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"pèi","traditional":"配","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"de","traditional":"地","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"gāo","traditional":"高","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"míng","traditional":"明","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"pèi","traditional":"配","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"yōu","traditional":"悠","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jiǔ","traditional":"久","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"无","pinyin":"wú","traditional":"無","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jiāng","traditional":"疆","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Luas dan tebal itu menyebabkan Ia selaras dengan bumi, Tinggi dan cemerlang itu menyebabkan Ia selaras dengan langit. Berlangsung lama dan jauh itu menyebabkan Ia tidak terbatas."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.26.05","number":5,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"rú","traditional":"如","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"cǐ","traditional":"此","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhě","traditional":"者","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"见","pinyin":"jiàn","traditional":"見","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhāng","traditional":"章","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"动","pinyin":"dòng","traditional":"動","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"变","pinyin":"biàn","traditional":"變","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"无","pinyin":"wú","traditional":"無","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"为","pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"為","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"chéng","traditional":"成","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Demikianlah, dengan tanpa menonjolkan diri telah terlihat jelas; dengan tanpa bergerak telah melakukan perubahan dan dengan tanpa berbuat, telah menyempurnakan."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.26.06","number":6,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"de","traditional":"地","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"kě","traditional":"可","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yī","traditional":"一","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yán","traditional":"言","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"尽","pinyin":"jǐn","traditional":"盡","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"为","pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"為","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wù","traditional":"物","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"贰","pinyin":"èr","traditional":"貳","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"则","pinyin":"zé","traditional":"則","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shēng","traditional":"生","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wù","traditional":"物","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"测","pinyin":"cè","traditional":"測","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Jalan Suci langit dan bumi itu cukup dinyatakan dengan satu kalimat saja: Yang menjadikan wujud itu bukan prinsip yang mendua; tetapi wujud yang tumbuh tidak dapat diperkirakan."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.26.07","number":7,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"de","traditional":"地","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"bó","traditional":"博","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"pinyin":"hòu","traditional":"厚","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"pinyin":"gāo","traditional":"高","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"pinyin":"míng","traditional":"明","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"pinyin":"yōu","traditional":"悠","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"pinyin":"jiǔ","traditional":"久","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Jalan Suci langit dan bumi itu luas, tebal, tinggi, gemilang, jauh dan abadi."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.26.08","number":8,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"jīn","traditional":"今","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"fū","traditional":"夫","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"sī","traditional":"斯","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhāo","traditional":"昭","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhāo","traditional":"昭","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"duō","traditional":"多","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"jí","traditional":"及","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"无","pinyin":"wú","traditional":"無","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"穷","pinyin":"qióng","traditional":"窮","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"rì","traditional":"日","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yuè","traditional":"月","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xīng","traditional":"星","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"chén","traditional":"辰","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xì","traditional":"系","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yān","traditional":"焉","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"万","pinyin":"wàn","traditional":"萬","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wù","traditional":"物","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"fù","traditional":"覆","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yān","traditional":"焉","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"jīn","traditional":"今","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"fū","traditional":"夫","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"de","traditional":"地","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yī","traditional":"一","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"cuō","traditional":"撮","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tǔ","traditional":"土","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"duō","traditional":"多","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"jí","traditional":"及","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"