n":"shòu","traditional":"獸","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jū","traditional":"居","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"宝","pinyin":"bǎo","traditional":"寶","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"cáng","traditional":"藏","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"兴","pinyin":"xìng","traditional":"興","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yān","traditional":"焉","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"jīn","traditional":"今","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"fū","traditional":"夫","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shuǐ","traditional":"水","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"yī","traditional":"一","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"sháo","traditional":"勺","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"duō","traditional":"多","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"jí","traditional":"及","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"测","pinyin":"cè","traditional":"測","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"鼋","pinyin":"yuán","traditional":"黿","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"modern":"鼍","pinyin":"tuó","traditional":"鼉","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"pinyin":"jiāo","traditional":"蛟","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"modern":"龙","pinyin":"lóng","traditional":"龍","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"modern":"鱼","pinyin":"yú","traditional":"魚","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"modern":"鳖","pinyin":"biē","traditional":"鱉","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shēng","traditional":"生","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yān","traditional":"焉","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"货","pinyin":"huò","traditional":"貨","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"财","pinyin":"cái","traditional":"財","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhí","traditional":"殖","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yān","traditional":"焉","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Sekarang dibicarakan tentang langit. Dari satu sudut, hanya berwujud sesuatu yang guram- suram, tetapi sesungguhnya tiada batasnya matahari, bulan, bintang-bintang dan cakrawala tertebar di dalamnya, berlaksa benda diliputinya. Sekarang dibicarakan tentang bumi. Dari satu sudut, tidak lebih dari segenggam tanah, tetapi sesungguhnya luas dan tebal. Gunung Hua dan Gak dapat didukungnya dengan tidak merasa berat; sungai dan laut dapat ditampung dengan tanpa tercecer dan segenap benda didukungnya. Sekarang dibicarakan tentang gunung. Dari satu sudut, tidak lebih dari sebutir batu, tetapi sesungguhnya sangat luas dan besar; rumput dan pohon-pohon tumbuh di atasnya, burung dan hewan diam di sana dan berbagai permata tersimpan di dalamnya. Sekarang dibicarakan tentang air. Dari satu sudut, tidak lebih dari segayung, tetapi sesungguhnya sangat tidak terduga; kura-kura besar, buaya, naga tak bertanduk dan bertanduk, ikan, bulus, hidup di dalamnya dan banyak pula barang-barang terdapat di dasarnya."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.26.09","number":9,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"modern":"诗","pinyin":"shī","traditional":"詩","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yún","traditional":"云","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，「"},{"modern":"维","pinyin":"wéi","traditional":"維","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"mìng","traditional":"命","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"于","pinyin":"yú","traditional":"於","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"mù","traditional":"穆","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"已","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。」"},{"modern":"盖","pinyin":"gài","traditional":"蓋","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yuē","traditional":"曰","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"suǒ","traditional":"所","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"为","pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"為","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。「"},{"modern":"于","pinyin":"yú","traditional":"於","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hū","traditional":"乎","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"显","pinyin":"xiǎn","traditional":"顯","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"wén","traditional":"文","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wáng","traditional":"王","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dé","traditional":"德","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"纯","pinyin":"chún","traditional":"純","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。」"},{"modern":"盖","pinyin":"gài","traditional":"蓋","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yuē","traditional":"曰","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"wén","traditional":"文","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wáng","traditional":"王","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"suǒ","traditional":"所","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"为","pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"為","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wén","traditional":"文","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"modern":"纯","pinyin":"chún","traditional":"純","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yì","traditional":"亦","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"已","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Di dalam Kitab Sanjak tertulis, \"Hanya Firman Tuhan YME sajalah Maha Mulia dan kekal.\" Kalimat ini hendak menyatakan 'Demikianlah sebabnya mengapa kita menyeru Tuhan YME dengan nama Tuhan YME. Tertulis pula, \"Ah, tidak jelaskah Kebajikan Murni Raja Wen - Bun?\" Kalimat ini hendak menyatakan `Demikianlah sebabnya mengapa Raja Wen - Bun disebut Bun, kemurniannya itu tidak berkesudahan.' (IV. A.2.1). TENGAH SEMPURNA BAB XXVI (Jalan Suci Nabi)"}],"source_file":"02 - Zhong Yong 中庸/26 - Bab XXV - Keabadian.md","title":"Bab XXV — Keabadian"}
